# PlatformIO build output
.pio/
# Regenerated by the ESP-IDF component manager on every build, and its
# manifest_hash flips between envs. The real pins (with their reasons) live
# in src/idf_component.yml; a lockfile that no CI step reads only adds churn.
dependencies.lock
# `pio run` regenerates these per env from sdkconfig.defaults; only the
# checked-in sdkconfig.<env> files are the source of truth.
sdkconfig.*.old

# Local build overrides: WiFi credentials, SK host, personal wake word.
# Boat config lives here and never in the repo — see platformio_local.ini.example.
platformio_local.ini

# Agent / tooling scratch
.claude/
.build/
cr-review-*

# Local capture + diagnostic artefacts. Mic probes (/mic_probe returns a
# WAV) and merged firmware images land here during on-hardware debugging;
# the merged image is a release asset built by CI, never a tracked file.
# Scoped rather than a blanket *.bin so a vendored component's binary can
# still be committed deliberately.
*.wav
/sensesp-p4-cockpit-merged*.bin
